# mold, target cross
### The linker of the builds when GCC_DEFAULT_LD or LLVM_DEFAULT_LD is mold (setup_full_toolchain):
### one host binary links every target architecture (the emulation comes from -m). zlib and zstd
### of the global toolchain, found through its RUNPATH, not the ones of the build host
PKG_DEPS="lfs/zlib:native lfs/zstd:native"
